<section class="summary section section--surface" aria-labelledby="summary-title">
  <div class="container summary__inner">
    <div class="summary__intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Executive summary</p>
      <h2 id="summary-title">
        We turn "we should probably automate that" into production systems —
        on budget, with an audit trail.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="summary__body">
      <p>
        SWRSWR is a three-partner IT consultancy specialising in process
        automation and the digitalization of legacy workflows. Our clients
        are mid-market manufacturers, logistics firms, insurers, and public
        sector bodies who have outgrown spreadsheets and point-solutions,
        but don't want a two-year transformation programme.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every engagement is fixed-scope and time-boxed. We ship working
        software, the documentation to run it, and a short playbook for the
        team who will own it after we leave. No lock-in, no seat licences,
        no mystery dependencies.
      </p>

      <ul class="summary__pillars" role="list">
        <li>
          <h3>Evidence over opinion</h3>
          <p class="muted">
            We measure the current process before we change it, and we publish
            the numbers after go-live.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Delivery is the deliverable</h3>
          <p class="muted">
            A production system your team actually uses beats a beautiful
            slide deck every time.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Ownership handover by design</h3>
          <p class="muted">
            From day one we pair with your staff so the team that runs it
            understands it.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .summary__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.5fr);
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .summary__intro h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.2vw, 1.9rem);
  }

  .summary__body p {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
  }

  .summary__pillars {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .summary__pillars li {
    padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .summary__pillars h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .summary__pillars p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.93rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .summary__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
